Keep a shared side as empty text.
Keep a shared coefficient as 0.
Keep a shared constant as 0.
Keep a shared collected as 0.
Keep a shared after as 0.
Keep a shared xnext as 0.
To finish from spot (a whole number) with total (a whole number).
Set collected to total.
Set after to spot.

To collect from spot (a whole number) with total (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of side, finish from spot with total, return.
The symbol is character spot of side.
If symbol is not between "0" and "9", finish from spot with total, return.
The digit is the digit value of symbol.
Collect from spot plus 1 with total times 10 plus digit.

To peek from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of side, set xnext to 0, return.
If character spot of side is "x", set xnext to 1, return.
Set xnext to 0.

To score from mark (a whole number) with amount (a whole number).
The folded is mark times amount.
Set coefficient to coefficient plus folded times xnext.
The other is 1 minus xnext.
Set constant to constant plus folded times other.

To advance from spot (a whole number) with mark (a whole number).
Set xnext to 1.
Score from mark with 1.
Inspect from spot plus 1 with mark.

To inspect from spot (a whole number) with mark (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of side, return.
The symbol is character spot of side.
If symbol is "+", inspect from spot plus 1 with 1.
If symbol is "-", inspect from spot plus 1 with -1.
If symbol is "x", advance from spot with mark.
If symbol is between "0" and "9".
Set collected to 0.
Set xnext to 0.
Collect from spot with 0.
Peek from after.
Score from mark with collected.
Inspect from after plus xnext with mark.

The equation is "x+5-3+x=6+x-2".
The sides is split equation by "=".
Set side to item 0 of sides.
Set coefficient to 0.
Set constant to 0.
Inspect from 0 with 1.
The leftcoefficient is coefficient.
The leftconstant is constant.
Set side to item 1 of sides.
Set coefficient to 0.
Set constant to 0.
Inspect from 0 with 1.
The slope is leftcoefficient minus coefficient.
The offset is constant minus leftconstant.
If slope is 0 and offset is 0, show "Infinite solutions".
If slope is 0 and offset is not 0, show "No solution".
If slope is not 0.
The value is offset divided by slope.
The answer is empty text.
Place "x=" into answer.
The piece is format whole number value as text.
Place piece into answer.
Show answer.
